urchase, acquire, dispose of, transact or interact with, or enter into any business relationship in connection with, any MLM program or Virtual Elements.  In the event that any of Customer's customers or end users, suffers any damage or injury, suffers any loss or incurs any cost or expense, in connection with any MLM program or Virtual Items made available by Customer through any of the Services or Software, such customer's or end user's sole remedy, if any, shall be against Customer, and in no event and under no circumstances shall such customer's or end user's sole remedy be against DSI.";

